<title>USA: Empi authorizes $7.5 mln for buying shares.</title>
<headline>Empi authorizes $7.5 mln for buying shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empi Inc, a medical device manufacturer, said Tuesday its board has authorized an additional $7.5 million to be used to repurchase shares in open market transactions to offset shasres issued through its employee stock ownership programs.</p>
<p>The company currently has 8.1 milion shares of capital stock outstanding.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
